-- Seed data for the airline assistant. Generated by db/gen_seed.py, which is
-- deterministic: rerunning it reproduces this file byte for byte.
--
-- All timestamps are UTC.
--
-- Demo scenario, used by the irregularity and reassignment tools:
--   AV201-2026-09-14  GUA to MEX 06:00, 20 seats, 18 sold (4 business). Cancel this one.
--   AV203-2026-09-14  same route 12:15, leaves 2 business and 4 economy free.
--   AV205-2026-09-14  same route 18:30, leaves 5 economy free, no business cabin.
--   AV201-2026-09-15  next morning, leaves 3 business and 8 economy free.
-- 18 displaced passengers against 11 same day seats forces the optimizer to
-- push the lowest priority 7 to the next morning.




